- Use the assets folder to store multimedia assets
- Use the common folder to store common component used in more than two components
- Use the hooks folder to store any custom hook for the website
- Use the pages folder to store each webpage of the website, each webpage is a folder with and index.tsx exporting the a parent component that host all the components that compose that webpage.
- Use the routing folder to store the react router component
- Use the services folder to store any service used to connect to any bacvkend services wether is our own backend service or a third party
- Always use factory bot to generate the instances of mock data and to generate the actual data use faker like the following example:

```
let(:user) = FactoryBot.create(email: Faker::Internet.email)
```
- While writting test NEVER use hard coded values instead make use of Faker API
- Always run any npm related command inside the frontend container use the docker compose file define at the root of the project for referece

### Component Structuring
- Each Component should be names in camel case formart
- Components can not have more than 25 lines of JSX template systax
- When a component has more than 25 lines break it down into sub components and move them into their own file into the nearesrt `Components` folder
- Components exported inside a index.tsx file are considered Main Components
- Components defined under any folder named `Components` are considered Small Components
- All Webpages are Main Components 
- When styling components write the styles in scss files under the nearest Styles that is at the same level as the parent `Components` folder and name the file with the same name as the component styled by that scss file.
- Always write a tests for Small Components, use react testing library to tests all use case of that component.
- Always save the test file next to the component is testing with the format Component1.test.tsx
- If a test file for a component already exists NEVER delete it or overwrite it, instead, append the new test case to the existant file
- General structure of a main component:

    MainComponent/
      ├── Components/
      │   ├── Component1.tsx
      │   ├── Component2.tsx
      │   └── Component3.tsx
      ├── Styles/        
      │   ├── Component1.scss
      │   ├── Component2.scss
      │   └── Component3.scss
      └── index.tsx
